        "status": "identified",
        "body": "We are investigating increased latency processing Metrics from APM and distribution metrics.\nAs a result of this issue, some users may see delays or gaps for metrics on graphs.\nTo prevent spurious alerts, we have temporarily disabled monitors based on this data.",
